 group-hover:w-[calc(100%-1rem)]\"></span></a></li></ul><a class=\"px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white bg-brand hover:brightness-110 rounded-xl transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\" href=\"#kontak\">Minta Proposal</a></div><button id=\"mobile-menu-toggle\" class=\"relative z-50 p-2.5 text-slate-900 md:hidden focus:outline-none bg-gray-50 rounded-xl transition-all active:scale-90\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><div class=\"relative w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"absolute w-6 h-0.5 bg-gray-900 rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"absolute w-6 h-0.5 bg-gray-900 rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"absolute w-6 h-0.5 bg-gray-900 rounded-full\"></div></div></button></nav></div></header><main class=\"pt-24 pb-16\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mb-8\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Portofolio & Sertifikasi\",\"item\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/portofolio-dan-sertifikasi\"}]}</script><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"flex items-center text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 \"><ol class=\"flex items-center flex-wrap gap-1.5 sm:gap-2\"><li class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-white font-semibold truncate max-w-[180px] sm:max-w-xs\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-house w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg>Portofolio &amp; Sertifikasi</span></li></ol></nav></div><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 border-t border-slate-200\" id=\"portofolio-sertifikasi\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ProfessionalService\",\"@id\":\"growthindonesia-credibility-portfolio\",\"name\":\"GROWTH INDONESIA - Provider Outbound & Event Management\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\",\"logo\":\"https://pub-50a5fd46ec724773a854a130ecf7860c.r2.dev/LOGO/SVG%20LOGO%20GROWTH.svg\",\"image\":\"https://pub-50a5fd46ec724773a854a130ecf7860c.r2.dev/LOGO/SVG%20LOGO%20GROWTH.svg\",\"description\":\"Provider outbound, team building, dan event management bersertifikat BNSP di Madiun & Jawa Timur. Berpengalaman menangani corporate gathering, capacity building, dan LDK OSIS.\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Jl. Mujair No.3, Nambangan Kidul, Kota Madiun, Jawa Timur\",\"addressLocality\":\"Madiun\",\"addressRegion\":\"Jawa Timur\",\"postalCode\":\"63128\",\"addressCountry\":\"ID\"},\"telephone\":\"+6285704748186\",\"priceRange\":\"Rp (Rupiah)\",\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":\"4.9\",\"reviewCount\":\"150\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"review\":[{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Bank Jatim (Cabang Madiun & Ponorogo)\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"Pelaksanaan Corporate Gathering & Capacity Building berjalan sangat sukses dengan Zero Accident Policy. Index kepuasan dan keterikatan karyawan meningkat hingga 98%.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMP Negeri 1 Geger\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-23\",\"reviewBody\":\"Kemah Besar & Character Building Outbound sangat efektif membentuk kedisiplinan dan kepemimpinan siswa melalui metode Experiential Learning.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Petrokimia Gresik & Semen Indonesia Group\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-11-12\",\"reviewBody\":\"Program Leadership Development & High Performance Team Training memberikan evaluasi kualitatif dan rekomendasi konkret untuk pengembangan SDM perusahaan.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"}}],\"employee\":[{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Naftalyndho\",\"jobTitle\":\"Lead Facilitator & Master Trainer\",\"hasCredential\":{\"@type\":\"EducationalOccupationalCredential\",\"credentialCategory\":\"Professional Certification\",\"name\":\"Sertifikat Kompetensi Fasilitator Outbound\",\"recognizedBy\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BNSP (Badan Nasional Sertifikasi Profesi)\"}}},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Juprianto\",\"jobTitle\":\"Senior Trainer & Safety Specialist\",\"hasCredential\":{\"@type\":\"EducationalOccupationalCredential\",\"credentialCategory\":\"Professional Certification\",\"name\":\"Sertifikat Kompetensi Instruktur Outbound\",\"recognizedBy\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BNSP (Badan Nasional Sertifikasi Profesi)\"}}}],\"knowsAbout\":[\"Experiential Learning\",\"BNSP Certified Outbound Facilitation\",\"Corporate Team Building\",\"Outdoor Safety & Zero Accident Policy\",\"LDK OSIS & Youth Leadership Training\"],\"memberOf\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Petrokimia Gresik\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Semen Indonesia\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Bank Jatim\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PT KAI (Persero)\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Pertamina\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PLN (Persero)\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PT Waskita Karya (Persero) Tbk\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PT Wijaya Karya (Persero) Tbk\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Maspion Group\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kapal Api Global\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Gudang Garam\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Wings Group\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMP Negeri 1 Geger Madiun\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMA Negeri 1 Madiun\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Universitas Brawijaya\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMA Negeri 2 Ponorogo\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMP Negeri 1 Magetan\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Pengurus LDK OSIS se-Eks Karesidenan Madiun\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Dinas Kehutanan Provinsi Jawa Timur (Ngawi)\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"RS Karya Husada\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BPR Pacitan\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Pemerintah Kota Madiun\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Pemerintah Kabupaten Magetan\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Dinas Kesehatan Kabupaten Ponorogo\"}],\"event\":[{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Kemah Besar & Character Building Outbound\",\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"GROWTH INDONESIA\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\"},\"sponsor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMP Negeri 1 Geger\"},\"performer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Naftalyndho Mycha Grace Mirawandi\",\"jobTitle\":\"Lead Facilitator\"},\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Ndalem Prabu Sarangan, Kabupaten Magetan\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Ndalem Prabu Sarangan, Kabupaten Magetan\",\"addressLocality\":\"Madiun\",\"addressRegion\":\"Jawa Timur\",\"postalCode\":\"63128\",\"addressCountry\":\"ID\"}},\"startDate\":\"2026-06-23T08:00:00+07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-06-23T17:00:00+07:00\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/#kontak\",\"price\":\"150000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"IDR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"description\":\"Membentuk karakter disiplin, menanamkan nilai nasionalisme, dan mengasah jiwa kepemimpinan generasi muda melalui pendekatan Experiential Learning. Outcomes: Pelaksanaan kegiatan dengan standar **Zero Accident Policy** tanpa insiden keselamatan. Peningkatan kemampuan komunikasi efektif dan pemecahan masalah (problem solving) antar regu. Pembentukan mentalitas tangguh dan empati sosial peserta melalui simulasi outdoor learning.\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Corporate Gathering & Capacity Building\",\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"GROWTH INDONESIA\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\"},\"sponsor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Bank Jatim (Kantor Cabang Madiun & Ponorogo)\"},\"performer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Naftalyndho Mycha Grace Mirawandi\",\"jobTitle\":\"Lead Facilitator\"},\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Kawasan Wisata Telaga Sarangan, Magetan\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Kawasan Wisata Telaga Sarangan, Magetan\",\"addressLocality\":\"Madiun\",\"addressRegion\":\"Jawa Timur\",\"postalCode\":\"63128\",\"addressCountry\":\"ID\"}},\"startDate\":\"2026-03-25T08:00:00+07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-25T17:00:00+07:00\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/#kontak\",\"price\":\"150000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"IDR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"description\":\"Mencairkan sekat komunikasi (silokanisasi) antar divisi, membangun kepercayaan (trust building), serta meningkatkan motivasi kerja pasca-periode target tahunan. Outcomes: Terbangunnya kesepakatan komitmen tim (team synergy commitment) baru untuk pencapaian target kerja. Sesi debriefing mendalam dengan penyusunan **Action Plan** konkret yang siap diaplikasikan di kantor. Peningkatan index kepuasan dan keterikatan karyawan (employee engagement score) sebesar 98%.\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Leadership Development & High Performance Team Training\",\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"GROWTH INDONESIA\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\"},\"sponsor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Petrokimia Gresik & Semen Indonesia Group\"},\"performer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Naftalyndho Mycha Grace Mirawandi\",\"jobTitle\":\"Lead Facilitator\"},\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Madiun & Batu, Jawa Timur\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Madiun & Batu, Jawa Timur\",\"addressLocality\":\"Madiun\",\"addressRegion\":\"Jawa Timur\",\"postalCode\":\"63128\",\"addressCountry\":\"ID\"}},\"startDate\":\"2025-11-12T08:00:00+07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-12T17:00:00+07:00\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/#kontak\",\"price\":\"150000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"IDR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"description\":\"Melatih kemampuan adaptasi di bawah tekanan, resolusi konflik internal, serta penguatan kepemimpinan transformasional bagi calon-calon manajer. Outcomes: Evaluasi kompetensi kepemimpinan melalui simulasi dinamika kelompok berbasis tantangan nyata. Sinergi lintas departemen yang lebih solid melalui metode evaluasi reflektif (Reflect & Conceptualize). Rekomendasi pengembangan SDM berbasis laporan kualitatif fasilitator bersertifikat BNSP.\"}]}</script><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 w-fit px-3 py-1 border border-red-500/30 text-red-600 bg-red-50 font-semibold\">Kredibilitas &amp; Legalitas Resmi</div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-800 rounded-full text-xs font-bold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-amber-500 text-amber-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><span>4.9 / 5.0 (150+ Ulasan &amp; Kepuasan Klien)</span></div></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">Profil Fasilitator, Studi Kasus &amp; <span class=\"text-red-600\">Portofolio Klien</span></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed\">Bukti nyata komitmen <strong>Growth Indonesia</strong> dalam menghadirkan program pengembangan SDM, outbound training, dan event management berstandar resmi <strong>BNSP</strong> dan bersertifikat keamanan tinggi.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">1. Profil &amp; Sertifikasi Fasilitator</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">Tim instruktur utama tersertifikasi kompetensi resmi negara (BNSP)</p></div></div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award w-4 h-4 text-red-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg>Sertifikasi BNSP Resmi</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\"><div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Naftalyndho</h4><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-red-600\">Lead Facilitator &amp; Master Trainer</p></div><span class=\"text-xs font-extrabold bg-red-600 text-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md\">BNSP</span></div><div class=\"space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60 text-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><div><span class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800\">Sertifikasi:</span> <!-- -->Sertifikat Kompetensi Fasilitator Outbound</div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><div><span class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800\">Penerbit:</span> <!-- -->BNSP (Badan Nasional Sertifikasi Profesi)</div></div></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2\">Spesialisasi Metodologi:</span><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><span class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium\">Experiential Learning</span><span class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium\">Corporate Capacity Building</span><span class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium\">Executive Leadership Development</span></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\"><div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Juprianto</h4><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-red-600\">Senior Trainer &amp; Safety Specialist</p></div><span class=\"text-xs font-extrabold bg-red-600 text-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md\">BNSP</span></div><div class=\"space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/60 text-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><div><span class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800\">Sertifikasi:</span> <!-- -->Sertifikat Kompetensi Instruktur Outbound</div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><div><span class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800\">Penerbit:</span> <!-- -->BNSP (Badan Nasional Sertifikasi Profesi)</div></div></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2\">Spesialisasi Metodologi:</span><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><span class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium\">Zero Accident Safety Protocol</span><span class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium\">Outdoor Risk Management</span><span class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium\">Team Synergy &amp; Debriefing</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-5 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-5 h-5 text-red-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><div><strong>Komitmen Keamanan &amp; Metodologi:</strong> Seluruh kegiatan kami menerapkan <strong>Zero Accident Policy</strong> yang diawasi langsung oleh instruktur keselamatan tersertifikasi. Simulasi dirancang menggunakan metodologi <strong>Experiential Learning (Experience → Reflect → Conceptualize → Apply)</strong> sehingga tidak sekadar rekreasi, melainkan berdampak langsung pada kinerja individu dan organisasi.</div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 pb-6\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-briefcase w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">2. Portofolio &amp; Studi Kasus Program</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">Rekam jejak pelaksanaan kegiatan outbound training, gathering, dan LDK OSIS</p></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-4 mb-4\"><div><h4 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Kemah Besar &amp; Character Building Outbound</h4><p class=\"text-base font-bold text-red-600\">SMP Negeri 1 Geger</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Ndalem Prabu Sarangan, Kabupaten Magetan</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>23 Juni 2026</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>350+ Siswa &amp; Pengurus OSIS</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"text-slate-900\">Tujuan Program:</strong> <!-- -->Membentuk karakter disiplin, menanamkan nilai nasionalisme, dan mengasah jiwa kepemimpinan generasi muda melalui pendekatan Experiential Learning.</p><div><strong class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-800 block mb-2\">Capaian &amp; Hasil Terukur (Outcomes):</strong><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Pelaksanaan kegiatan dengan standar <strong>Zero Accident Policy</strong> tanpa insiden keselamatan.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Peningkatan kemampuan komunikasi efektif dan pemecahan masalah (problem solving) antar regu.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Pembentukan mentalitas tangguh dan empati sosial peserta melalui simulasi outdoor learning.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-4 mb-4\"><div><h4 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Corporate Gathering &amp; Capacity Building</h4><p class=\"text-base font-bold text-red-600\">Bank Jatim (Kantor Cabang Madiun &amp; Ponorogo)</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Kawasan Wisata Telaga Sarangan, Magetan</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>25 Maret 2026</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>120 Karyawan &amp; Manajemen</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"text-slate-900\">Tujuan Program:</strong> <!-- -->Mencairkan sekat komunikasi (silokanisasi) antar divisi, membangun kepercayaan (trust building), serta meningkatkan motivasi kerja pasca-periode target tahunan.</p><div><strong class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-800 block mb-2\">Capaian &amp; Hasil Terukur (Outcomes):</strong><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Terbangunnya kesepakatan komitmen tim (team synergy commitment) baru untuk pencapaian target kerja.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Sesi debriefing mendalam dengan penyusunan <strong>Action Plan</strong> konkret yang siap diaplikasikan di kantor.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Peningkatan index kepuasan dan keterikatan karyawan (employee engagement score) sebesar 98%.</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-4 mb-4\"><div><h4 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Leadership Development &amp; High Performance Team Training</h4><p class=\"text-base font-bold text-red-600\">Petrokimia Gresik &amp; Semen Indonesia Group</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Madiun &amp; Batu, Jawa Timur</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-3.5 h-3.5 text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>12 November 2025</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" cla