anization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Kapal Api Global\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Gudang Garam\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Wings Group\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"SMP Negeri 1 Geger Madiun\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"SMA Negeri 1 Madiun\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Universitas Brawijaya\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"SMA Negeri 2 Ponorogo\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"SMP Negeri 1 Magetan\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Pengurus LDK OSIS se-Eks Karesidenan Madiun\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dinas Kehutanan Provinsi Jawa Timur (Ngawi)\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"RS Karya Husada\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"BPR Pacitan\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Pemerintah Kota Madiun\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Pemerintah Kabupaten Magetan\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dinas Kesehatan Kabupaten Ponorogo\\\"}],\\\"event\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Event\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Kemah Besar \\u0026 Character Building Outbound\\\",\\\"organizer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"GROWTH INDONESIA\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\\\"},\\\"sponsor\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"SMP Negeri 1 Geger\\\"},\\\"performer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Person\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Naftalyndho Mycha Grace Mirawandi\\\",\\\"jobTitle\\\":\\\"Lead Facilitator\\\"},\\\"location\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Place\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Ndalem Prabu Sarangan, Kabupaten Magetan\\\",\\\"address\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"PostalAddress\\\",\\\"streetAddress\\\":\\\"Ndalem Prabu Sarangan, Kabupaten Magetan\\\",\\\"addressLocality\\\":\\\"Madiun\\\",\\\"addressRegion\\\":\\\"Jawa Timur\\\",\\\"postalCode\\\":\\\"63128\\\",\\\"addressCountry\\\":\\\"ID\\\"}},\\\"startDate\\\":\\\"2026-06-23T08:00:00+07:00\\\",\\\"endDate\\\":\\\"2026-06-23T17:00:00+07:00\\\",\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/#kontak\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"150000\\\",\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"IDR\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\"},\\\"description\\\":\\\"Membentuk karakter disiplin, menanamkan nilai nasionalisme, dan mengasah jiwa kepemimpinan generasi muda melalui pendekatan Experiential Learning. Outcomes: Pelaksanaan kegiatan dengan standar **Zero Accident Policy** tanpa insiden keselamatan. Peningkatan kemampuan komunikasi efektif dan pemecahan masalah (problem solving) antar regu. Pembentukan mentalitas tangguh dan empati sosial peserta melalui simulasi outdoor learning.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Event\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Corporate Gathering \\u0026 Capacity Building\\\",\\\"organizer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"GROWTH INDONESIA\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\\\"},\\\"sponsor\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Bank Jatim (Kantor Cabang Madiun \\u0026 Ponorogo)\\\"},\\\"performer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Person\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Naftalyndho Mycha Grace Mirawandi\\\",\\\"jobTitle\\\":\\\"Lead Facilitator\\\"},\\\"location\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Place\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Kawasan Wisata Telaga Sarangan, Magetan\\\",\\\"address\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"PostalAddress\\\",\\\"streetAddress\\\":\\\"Kawasan Wisata Telaga Sarangan, Magetan\\\",\\\"addressLocality\\\":\\\"Madiun\\\",\\\"addressRegion\\\":\\\"Jawa Timur\\\",\\\"postalCode\\\":\\\"63128\\\",\\\"addressCountry\\\":\\\"ID\\\"}},\\\"startDate\\\":\\\"2026-03-25T08:00:00+07:00\\\",\\\"endDate\\\":\\\"2026-03-25T17:00:00+07:00\\\",\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/#kontak\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"150000\\\",\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"IDR\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\"},\\\"description\\\":\\\"Mencairkan sekat komunikasi (silokanisasi) antar divisi, membangun kepercayaan (trust building), serta meningkatkan motivasi kerja pasca-periode target tahunan. Outcomes: Terbangunnya kesepakatan komitmen tim (team synergy commitment) baru untuk pencapaian target kerja. Sesi debriefing mendalam dengan penyusunan **Action Plan** konkret yang siap diaplikasikan di kantor. Peningkatan index kepuasan dan keterikatan karyawan (employee engagement score) sebesar 98%.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Event\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Leadership Development \\u0026 High Performance Team Training\\\",\\\"organizer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"GROWTH INDONESIA\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\\\"},\\\"sponsor\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Petrokimia Gresik \\u0026 Semen Indonesia Group\\\"},\\\"performer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Person\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Naftalyndho Mycha Grace Mirawandi\\\",\\\"jobTitle\\\":\\\"Lead Facilitator\\\"},\\\"location\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Place\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Madiun \\u0026 Batu, Jawa Timur\\\",\\\"address\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"PostalAddress\\\",\\\"streetAddress\\\":\\\"Madiun \\u0026 Batu, Jawa Timur\\\",\\\"addressLocality\\\":\\\"Madiun\\\",\\\"addressRegion\\\":\\\"Jawa Timur\\\",\\\"postalCode\\\":\\\"63128\\\",\\\"addressCountry\\\":\\\"ID\\\"}},\\\"startDate\\\":\\\"2025-11-12T08:00:00+07:00\\\",\\\"endDate\\\":\\\"2025-11-12T17:00:00+07:00\\\",\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/#kontak\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"150000\\\",\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"IDR\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\"},\\\"description\\\":\\\"Melatih kemampuan adaptasi di bawah tekanan, resolusi konflik internal, serta penguatan kepemimpinan transformasional bagi calon-calon manajer. Outcomes: Evaluasi kompetensi kepemimpinan melalui simulasi dinamika kelompok berbasis tantangan nyata. Sinergi lintas departemen yang lebih solid melalui metode evaluasi reflektif (Reflect \\u0026 Conceptualize). Rekomendasi pengembangan SDM berbasis laporan kualitatif fasilitator bersertifikat BNSP.\\\"}]}\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"relative min-h-screen bg-slate-50 selection:bg-[#EF4444] selection:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"header\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"navbar\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 border-b bg-white shadow-md border-gray-100 h-20\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto h-full px-6 md:px-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"nav\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center justify-between h-full\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L6\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"relative z-50 flex items-center group active:scale-95 transition-transform\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Growth Indonesia Home\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Lf\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://pub-50a5fd46ec724773a854a130ecf7860c.r2.dev/LOGO/SVG%20LOGO%20GROWTH.svg\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"GROWTH INDONESIA - Corporate Outbound \\u0026 Event Organizer Madiun\\\",\\\"width\\\":200,\\\"height\\\":48,\\\"className\\\":\\\"h-10 md:h-12 w-auto object-contain transition-all duration-300 group-hover:brightness-110\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"width\\\":\\\"auto\\\"},\\\"referrerPolicy\\\":\\\"no-referrer\\\",\\\"priority\\\":true}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 lg:gap-10\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center gap-8 lg:gap-10\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"Beranda\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L6\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"gr