bound, team building, dan event management bersertifikat BNSP di Madiun & Jawa Timur. Berpengalaman menangani corporate gathering, capacity building, dan LDK OSIS.\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Jl. Mujair No.3, Nambangan Kidul, Kota Madiun, Jawa Timur\",\"addressLocality\":\"Madiun\",\"addressRegion\":\"Jawa Timur\",\"postalCode\":\"63128\",\"addressCountry\":\"ID\"},\"telephone\":\"+6285704748186\",\"priceRange\":\"Rp (Rupiah)\",\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":\"4.9\",\"reviewCount\":\"150\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"review\":[{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Bank Jatim (Cabang Madiun & Ponorogo)\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-25\",\"reviewBody\":\"Pelaksanaan Corporate Gathering & Capacity Building berjalan sangat sukses dengan Zero Accident Policy. Index kepuasan dan keterikatan karyawan meningkat hingga 98%.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMP Negeri 1 Geger\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-23\",\"reviewBody\":\"Kemah Besar & Character Building Outbound sangat efektif membentuk kedisiplinan dan kepemimpinan siswa melalui metode Experiential Learning.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Petrokimia Gresik & Semen Indonesia Group\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-11-12\",\"reviewBody\":\"Program Leadership Development & High Performance Team Training memberikan evaluasi kualitatif dan rekomendasi konkret untuk pengembangan SDM perusahaan.\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\"}}],\"employee\":[{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Naftalyndho\",\"jobTitle\":\"Lead Facilitator & Master Trainer\",\"hasCredential\":{\"@type\":\"EducationalOccupationalCredential\",\"credentialCategory\":\"Professional Certification\",\"name\":\"Sertifikat Kompetensi Fasilitator Outbound\",\"recognizedBy\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BNSP (Badan Nasional Sertifikasi Profesi)\"}}},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Juprianto\",\"jobTitle\":\"Senior Trainer & Safety Specialist\",\"hasCredential\":{\"@type\":\"EducationalOccupationalCredential\",\"credentialCategory\":\"Professional Certification\",\"name\":\"Sertifikat Kompetensi Instruktur Outbound\",\"recognizedBy\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BNSP (Badan Nasional Sertifikasi Profesi)\"}}}],\"knowsAbout\":[\"Experiential Learning\",\"BNSP Certified Outbound Facilitation\",\"Corporate Team Building\",\"Outdoor Safety & Zero Accident Policy\",\"LDK OSIS & Youth Leadership Training\"],\"memberOf\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Petrokimia Gresik\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Semen Indonesia\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Bank Jatim\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PT KAI (Persero)\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Pertamina\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PLN (Persero)\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PT Waskita Karya (Persero) Tbk\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PT Wijaya Karya (Persero) Tbk\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Maspion Group\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kapal Api Global\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Gudang Garam\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Wings Group\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMP Negeri 1 Geger Madiun\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMA Negeri 1 Madiun\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Universitas Brawijaya\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMA Negeri 2 Ponorogo\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMP Negeri 1 Magetan\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Pengurus LDK OSIS se-Eks Karesidenan Madiun\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Dinas Kehutanan Provinsi Jawa Timur (Ngawi)\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"RS Karya Husada\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BPR Pacitan\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Pemerintah Kota Madiun\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Pemerintah Kabupaten Magetan\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Dinas Kesehatan Kabupaten Ponorogo\"}],\"event\":[{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Kemah Besar & Character Building Outbound\",\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"GROWTH INDONESIA\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\"},\"sponsor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"SMP Negeri 1 Geger\"},\"performer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Naftalyndho Mycha Grace Mirawandi\",\"jobTitle\":\"Lead Facilitator\"},\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Ndalem Prabu Sarangan, Kabupaten Magetan\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Ndalem Prabu Sarangan, Kabupaten Magetan\",\"addressLocality\":\"Madiun\",\"addressRegion\":\"Jawa Timur\",\"postalCode\":\"63128\",\"addressCountry\":\"ID\"}},\"startDate\":\"2026-06-23T08:00:00+07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-06-23T17:00:00+07:00\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/#kontak\",\"price\":\"150000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"IDR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"description\":\"Membentuk karakter disiplin, menanamkan nilai nasionalisme, dan mengasah jiwa kepemimpinan generasi muda melalui pendekatan Experiential Learning. Outcomes: Pelaksanaan kegiatan dengan standar **Zero Accident Policy** tanpa insiden keselamatan. Peningkatan kemampuan komunikasi efektif dan pemecahan masalah (problem solving) antar regu. Pembentukan mentalitas tangguh dan empati sosial peserta melalui simulasi outdoor learning.\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Corporate Gathering & Capacity Building\",\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"GROWTH INDONESIA\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\"},\"sponsor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Bank Jatim (Kantor Cabang Madiun & Ponorogo)\"},\"performer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Naftalyndho Mycha Grace Mirawandi\",\"jobTitle\":\"Lead Facilitator\"},\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Kawasan Wisata Telaga Sarangan, Magetan\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Kawasan Wisata Telaga Sarangan, Magetan\",\"addressLocality\":\"Madiun\",\"addressRegion\":\"Jawa Timur\",\"postalCode\":\"63128\",\"addressCountry\":\"ID\"}},\"startDate\":\"2026-03-25T08:00:00+07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-25T17:00:00+07:00\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/#kontak\",\"price\":\"150000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"IDR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"description\":\"Mencairkan sekat komunikasi (silokanisasi) antar divisi, membangun kepercayaan (trust building), serta meningkatkan motivasi kerja pasca-periode target tahunan. Outcomes: Terbangunnya kesepakatan komitmen tim (team synergy commitment) baru untuk pencapaian target kerja. Sesi debriefing mendalam dengan penyusunan **Action Plan** konkret yang siap diaplikasikan di kantor. Peningkatan index kepuasan dan keterikatan karyawan (employee engagement score) sebesar 98%.\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Leadership Development & High Performance Team Training\",\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"GROWTH INDONESIA\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id\"},\"sponsor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Petrokimia Gresik & Semen Indonesia Group\"},\"performer\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Naftalyndho Mycha Grace Mirawandi\",\"jobTitle\":\"Lead Facilitator\"},\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Madiun & Batu, Jawa Timur\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Madiun & Batu, Jawa Timur\",\"addressLocality\":\"Madiun\",\"addressRegion\":\"Jawa Timur\",\"postalCode\":\"63128\",\"addressCountry\":\"ID\"}},\"startDate\":\"2025-11-12T08:00:00+07:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-11-12T17:00:00+07:00\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://growthindonesia.my.id/#kontak\",\"price\":\"150000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"IDR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"description\":\"Melatih kemampuan adaptasi di bawah tekanan, resolusi konflik internal, serta penguatan kepemimpinan transformasional bagi calon-calon manajer. Outcomes: Evaluasi kompetensi kepemimpinan melalui simulasi dinamika kelompok berbasis tantangan nyata. Sinergi lintas departemen yang lebih solid melalui metode evaluasi reflektif (Reflect & Conceptualize). Rekomendasi pengembangan SDM berbasis laporan kualitatif fasilitator bersertifikat BNSP.\"}]}b:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative min-h-screen bg-slate-50 selection:bg-[#EF4444] selection:text-white\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"id\":\"navbar\",\"className\":\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 border-b bg-white shadow-md border-gray-100 h-20\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto h-full px-6 md:px-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between h-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"relative z-50 flex items-center group active:scale-95 transition-transform\",\"aria-label\":\"Growth Indonesia Home\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"src\":\"https://pub-50a5fd46ec724773a854a130ecf7860c.r2.dev/LOGO/SVG%20LOGO%20GROWTH.svg\",\"alt\":\"GROWTH INDONESIA - Corporate Outbound & Event Organizer Madiun\",\"width\":200,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-10 md:h-12 w-auto object-contain transition-all duration-300 group-hover:brightness-110\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"auto\"},\"referrerPolicy\":\"no-referrer\",\"priority\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 lg:gap-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-8 lg:gap-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Beranda\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,